","children":["When making an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," attack, you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Brace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Brace"}," a Weapon that is not restricted to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"},"-only. You must be proficient with the weapon being used to activate this Talent.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Crushing Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use your attacks to beat down your opponents' defenses. When you successfully damage an opponent using a Bludgeoning weapon that you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]}," Talent for, your next attack against that opponent made before the end of the encounter gains a +2 bonus on the attack roll and to the damage roll. The effects of multiple ",{"tag":"b","children":["Crushing Assaults"]}," do not stack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Disarming Attack"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Disarm","referenceId":"reference:ad868a04c89cdc16"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Choose a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"}," with which you are proficient. You ignore a target's Armor bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarming"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarming"}," with such a weapon. Additionally, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", once per encounter, you can grant yourself a +10 bonus on your attack roll when attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disarm"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disarm","referenceId":"reference:0449aa195af99b14"}," an opponent while using such a weapon.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Impaling Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can hit your opponents to slow them down. Whenever you successfully damage an opponent using a Piercing weapon that you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]}," Talent for, your opponent reduces its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," by 2 squares until the end of your next turn. The effects of multiple ",{"tag":"b","children":["Impaling Assaults"]}," do not stack.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Suppression Fire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Suppress an Enemy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Suppress_an_Enemy"}," using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action, that enemy takes a -5 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn. When targeting an area with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Autofire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Autofire"}," weapon, each enemy in the attack area takes a -2 penalty on its attack rolls until the start of your next turn, regardless of whether your attack hits.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stinging Assault"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can deliver nasty injuries that leave your opponents reeling. Whenever you successfully damage an opponent using a Slashing weapon that you have the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Specialization"]}," Talent for, your opponent takes a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"}," against you until the start of your next turn. The effects of multiple ",{"tag":"b","children":["Stinging Assaults"]}," do not stack.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
